    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d550">

                <pb facs="0663" n="581" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg581"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Romero to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexican Legation to the United
                                States, Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-07-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 15, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary</hi>: I have the honor to remit to your
                    department, for the information of the government of the United States, copies
                    in English and French of a protest which Don Jesus Escobary Armendariz, agent of
                    the Mexican government, made in the city of London, the 10th of June last past,
                    against all the acts of French intervention in Mexico, and of the functionaries
                    emanating therefrom, and principally against the loan which the Archduke
                        Ferdinand<pb facs="0664" n="582" xml:id="pg582"/>Maximilian of Austria
                    decreed on the 10th of April previous, pretending by that act to commit the
                    credit of the Mexican nation.</p>
                <p>I avail of this opportunity to repeat to you the assurances of my very
                    distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>M. ROMERO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d550-a1.xml" xpointer="d550-a1"/>
            </div>
